Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.83,0:00:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnFredoka\b1\fs20\1c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\bord0.5\pos(88.8,53.333)}An Eye for an Eye, datsun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.82,0:00:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Kikkun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.02,0:00:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an5\t(25,50,\fscx105\fscy95)\t(50,100,\fscx95\fscy105)\pos(182.4,277.333)}{\b1\i1}Aliens, get out of Earth! Get out!{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.58,0:00:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an5\t(25,20,\fscx105\fscy95)\t(50,100,\fscx95\fscy105,)\b1\i1\pos(188.8,280.533)}Get out!{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.34,0:00:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That's intense.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.62,0:00:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Those anti-alien faction guys act up every once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.72,0:00:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Most Earthlings are nice and get along with us, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.72,0:00:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, I can't take this anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.82,0:00:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Kikkun, calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.36,0:00:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,No way! Tsuntsun is trying to take a nap, \Nand these guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.48,0:00:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,An eye for an eye!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.43,0:00:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Kikkun! If you do that-
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.50,0:00:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,it's a tooth for a tooth!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.15,0:00:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a tooth!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.37,0:00:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,A flute!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.47,0:00:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.35,0:00:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Those guys outside with a full-force flute tune!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.67,0:00:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.63,0:00:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You really get it? 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.74,0:00:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna show them how an alien's tune is totally different from an Earthling's tune!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.07,0:00:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there even a difference in a tune?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.87,0:00:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Passen... pagonde... Their lives are gonna change completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.43,0:00:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it'll be carved deep into the musical history of humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.84,0:00:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Musical history? From a historical point of view, \Nwhat on earth are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.74,0:00:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnFredoka\b1\fs24\1c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\bord0.5\pos(198.4,108.8)}Several hours later
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.00,0:00:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Everyone's quietly going back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.30,0:00:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,True. 
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.50,0:01:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on, tsun?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.39,0:01:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I wake you up, Tsuntsun?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.17,0:01:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It was too noisy outside, tsun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.91,0:01:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, sorry. It's quiet now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.23,0:01:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't really get it, \Nbut all the people making a ruckus just went home.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.47,0:01:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, that's because I implanted chips \Ninto their brains, tsun-yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.47,0:01:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You controlled them and sent them back?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.71,0:01:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I slipped something super tiny into their ears, tsun!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.07,0:01:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You know wire-hair worms, right, tsun? \NUsing that same principle, right into their ears-
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.70,0:01:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,A-Tsuntsun, you don't need to say any more! Daddy and the others are getting scared!
